{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261023/photo/bkn-20261023163507054-1023_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261023173541\"/><p>司機被送往屯門醫院救治。</p><p>今日(23日)下午3時48分，元朗青山公路潭尾段18號一屋苑的保安員報案，指在屋苑對開發現一輛車頭受損的私家車，他嘗試拍打車窗，但是車內司機毫無反應，懷疑陷入昏迷。救援人員隨即到場，並且將司機送往屯門醫院救治；警員經初步調查後，相信該輛私家車在較早前「自炒」，惟車禍過程有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:03:52.342906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:35:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.842452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:58:06.389676+00:00","content_hash":"e46ff056515804910b4d700eafcb72488452198bcbadb961da40bae70b43c58a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:03:52.342906+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}